
<%args>
  $logged_in_username
  $private_email => ''
</%args>

<& /page/page_title.mas, title => "更新使用者資訊(Update User Information)" &>

請驗證您目前的密碼以進行修改。勾選相應的核取方塊並輸入新資訊以選取所需之變更。<br /><br />

<style>

.textlabel {
  width: 200px;
  white-space: nowrap;
  max-width: 150px;
  overflow: hidden;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
  float:left;     
}

.input { 
  width: 200px;
  white-space:nowrap;
}

.checkboxes { 
  width: 20px;
  text-align: left;
}

.form-control { 
  width: 200px;
}

</style>

<form id="change_account_form" name="change_account_form"> 
<div>
  <label class="textlabel" for="current_password" id="current_password_label">目前密碼(Current password) <font color="red">*</font></label>
  <input type="password" class="form-control" id="current_password" name="current_password" />
</div>

<br />
<h4><input type="checkbox" id="change_password" name="change_password">變更密碼(Change password)</input></h4>

<div>
  <label class="textlabel" for="new_password" >新密碼(New password)</label>
  <input class="form-control" id="new_password" name="new_password" type="password" />
</div>

<div>
  <label class="textlabel" for="confirm_password" >確認密碼(Confirm password)</label>
  <input class="form-control" id="confirm_password" name="confirm_password" type="password" />
</div>
<br />
<br />

<h4><input type="checkbox" id="change_email" name="change_email">變更電子郵件(Change email)</input></h4>
<div>您的私人電子郵件地址不會公開顯示於線上。該地址僅供工作人員就您記錄的變更與您聯絡，或用於向您寄送密碼。變更私人電子郵件地址將觸發一封確認信件以驗證該地址有效可用。</div><br />
<div>
  <label class="textlabel" for="private_email" >新電子郵件(New email)</label>
  <input class="form-control" id="private_email" name="private_email" value="<% $private_email %>" />
</div>
<div>
  <label class="textlabel" for="confirm_email" >確認電子郵件(Confirm email)</label>
  <input class="form-control" id="confirm_email" name="confirm_email" value="<% $private_email %>" />
</div>

<br />
<br />
<h4><input class="checkboxes" type="checkbox" id="change_username" name="change_username">變更使用者名稱(Change username)</input></h4>
<div>
  <label class="textlabel" for="new_username">新使用者名稱(New username)</label>
  <input class="form-control" id="new_username" name="new_username" value="<% $logged_in_username %>" />
</div>

<br />

<br />
<br />
<button class="btn btn-secondary" type="clear_form" id="clear_form">重設表單(Reset form)</button>

<button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary" id="submit_account_info">變更帳號資訊(Change Account Information)</button>

</form>


<script>
  jQuery(document).ready( function() { 
    jQuery('#change_account_form').submit( function(event) { 
       event.preventDefault();
       var form_data = jQuery('#change_account_form').serialize();
       // alert(JSON.stringify(form_data));
       jQuery.ajax( { 
         url: '/ajax/user/update',
         data: form_data,
         error: function(r) { alert('發生錯誤！抱歉！(An error occurred!)');  },
         success: function(r) {
           if (r.error) { alert(r.error); }
           else { 
             alert("完成！(Done!) " +r.message);
           }
         }
       });
    });
  });

</script>
